WEBVTT

00:14:28.191 --> 00:14:30.719
If you're outside,
find a window and look in.

00:14:30.743 --> 00:14:33.344
Or do a quick YouTube
or Google image search

00:14:33.368 --> 00:14:35.140
for "baby [your favorite animal.]"

00:14:35.164 --> 00:14:37.965
Do it on your phones,
or just shout out some baby animals,

00:14:37.989 --> 00:14:39.541
and I'll put them on the screen.

00:14:39.565 --> 00:14:41.021
So, what do we want to see?

00:14:41.045 --> 00:14:46.498
Sloth, giraffe, elephant, snake.
Okay, let's see what we got.

00:14:46.522 --> 00:14:51.219
Baby dolphin and baby llamas.
Everybody look.

00:14:51.775 --> 00:14:52.993
Got that?

00:14:53.017 --> 00:14:55.248
Okay, one more. Baby elephant.

00:14:55.272 --> 00:14:56.437
(Audience) Oh!

00:14:56.461 --> 00:14:57.922
We're clapping for that?

00:14:57.946 --> 00:14:59.130
That's amazing.

00:14:59.154 --> 00:15:00.246
(Laughter)